  "findings": [
    "Independent tile-first and work-first models agree, including ownership starts/finishes through unaccepted attempts and changing work/batch sizes.",
    "The storage fixture forces real overflow in a shuffled interior tile, loses a durable acknowledgment before or after that first tile completes, then recovers all missing ordinals exactly once in each policy.",
    "The new forty-case storage fixture exceeded its initial 180-second ASan/UBSan deadline. Only its CTest timeout changed to 600 seconds; the unchanged binary passed its focused rerun. Initial and retry logs are retained. No production change was required during acceptance."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Random-window shuffles the next W tiles from the lowest missing endpoints and exhausts the window. It is local randomization, not globally uniform selection or replacement sampling.",
    "Seed is a 256-bit hexadecimal ordering value (default zero); W is 1..256 tiles (default 64). Both overrides require random-window.",
    "Tile/work geometry is frozen per window. Overflow replans the same tile suffix; successful sub-batches advance within it before another shuffled tile is selected. Later windows sample current limits.",
    "At most W tile records and W active work owners exist beyond input gaps. Each owner records only its own execution/replay time, excluding pauses and other owners.",
    "The SHA-256 domain/seed/counter stream and masked rejection draws specify portable Fisher-Yates order; no security or throughput claim.",
    "Canonical receipts permit restart with changed seed/window, geometry, device or supported order. The stream resets over saved gaps; submission sequence may differ.",
    "No kernel arithmetic, persisted job/configuration/schema/protocol/capability change. Existing minikeys-v1 workers remain compatible.",
    "Both lengths and all encodings are tested. Eight-device spots alternate lengths; no full device-by-length product or fleet scaling claim.",
    "Fourteen focused host ASan/UBSan gates; no whole-application or device-code sanitizer claim.",
    "Scalar families\u2019 alternative traversal remains pending in C23.",
    "Public fixtures only; no enrollment credentials or journal databases archived."
  ],
